{
 "name": "HL · Email · Monday report",
 "nodes": [
  {
   "parameters": {
    "content": "## HL · Email: Monday report (Lesson 5.6)\nMondays 08:00: the last campaign's delivered, clicks, unsubscribes and complaints from Brevo, plus orders traced to email (utm_source=email). Opens are left out on purpose: automatic image loading makes them unreliable.\nIf complaints pass 0.1% of delivered, email_paused is switched on, so the next newsletter waits until Tolu looks at frequency and relevance.\n\nCredentials: Header Auth \"Brevo API key\" (Name api-key, Value your Brevo API key); Postgres (Supabase, your orders table); Google Sheets; Telegram.\nPlaceholders: YOUR_SHEET_ID, YOUR_TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID. Adjust the orders query to your table (it expects utm_source and total columns).",
    "height": 340,
    "width": 520
   },
   "id": "6a7b3e6a-d931-4512-96c6-34aa656e0b9a",
   "name": "Note 1",
